@baseUrl = http://localhost:5273

### Create a post and generate its embedding
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lisica u šumi",
  "content": "Fotografija crvene lisice koja prolazi kroz jesenju šumu."
}

### Analyze an image and rank it against posts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/images/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/red-fox.png",
  "mimeType": "image/png",
  "imageBase64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAIAAACQd1PeAAAADUlEQVR4nGP4z8AAAAMBAQDJ/pLvAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC"
}

### Get images ranked for a post. Replace the ID with the post ID from the create response.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/images
Accept: application/json

### Approve a suggestion. Replace IDs with values from the process response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "imageId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "isApproved": true
}

### Reject a suggestion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "imageId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "isApproved": false,
  "rejectionReason": "Slika nije dovoljno relevantna za sadržaj posta."
}
